#. <CLT 4>誰もいない教室の片隅に彼女はいた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I found her in one corner of an empty classroom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>イスに腰掛け、膝の上で組んだ手に、
#. ぼんやりとした視線を落としている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She was sitting in a chair, hands on her knees,\n"
"staring absently at the floor.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>泣いているようにも見えるし、
#. 怒っているようにも見える。いや…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She looked like maybe she was upset, or angry. Or,\n"
"no...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…表情なんてない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...She didn't have any expression at all.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこには…表情と呼ばれるものは何もなかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There was nothing on her face that you could call\n"
"emotion.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まるで、仮面がそぎ落とされたかのように…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was as if her original mask had been stripped away.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ま、舞園さん…大丈夫…？
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-Sayaka? Are you okay?"
msgstr ""

#. はい…大丈夫……
msgctxt "0008 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Yeah...I'm fine."
msgstr ""

#. …な訳ないじゃないですか…
msgctxt "0009 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Actually, no...how could I possibly be fine?"
msgstr ""

#. 私達が…何をしたって言うの…？
msgctxt "0010 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "What did we do to end up like this...?"
msgstr ""

#. どうして…こんな酷い事をするの？
msgctxt "0011 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Why are they doing such terrible things to us...?"
msgstr ""

#. 出してッ！　今すぐ私をここから出してよッ！！
msgctxt "0012 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I want out! Let me out of here right now!"
msgstr ""

#. …舞園さん！　落ち着いて！！
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sayaka! Calm down!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、暴れる彼女の両肩を強く掴んだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As she thrashed around, I grabbed her by the\n"
"shoulders.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ッ！！
msgctxt "0015 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "...!"
msgstr ""

#. 気持ちは…わかるよ…
#. ボクだって、自分の家族に何かあったらって思うと…
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I understand. I know how you feel right now. When I\n"
"think what might have happened to my family..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、こんな時だからこそ冷静にならなきゃ！
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But now more than ever we have to stay calm!"
msgstr ""

#. ボクらの冷静な判断を奪う事こそが、
#. 黒幕の狙いなんだ…
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"This is exactly what they want. They *want* us to lose\n"
"our composure and stop thinking rationally."
msgstr ""

#. 大体、あんな映像…
#. でっち上げに決まってるって！
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Think about it—those videos have to be fake!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、あんな事になってたら…
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Because if those things really had happened..."
msgstr ""

#. あんな事になってたら…
#. 今頃、警察だって大騒ぎしているはずだよ…
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...people out there would be in an uproar. Our\n"
"families, the police, everyone!"
msgstr ""

#. …そうでしょ？
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Right?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0023 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. だから…冷静になろ？
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So let's just calm down, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. 冷静にならなきゃ…駄目なんだ……
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Otherwise, we've already lost."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それは…なかば自分に言い聞かせるような言葉だった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I knew I was trying to convince myself just as much as\n"
"her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>脳裏に焼きついたさっきの映像を振り払うように、
#. ボクは、その言葉を連呼した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I kept repeating those words to myself, to clear away\n"
"the images that had been burned into my brain.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>冷静になれ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Be calm, okay?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>冷静に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just be calm...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. きっと…みんなで協力すれば、
#. 逃げ道を見つけられるはずだよ。
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"As long as we work together, I'm sure we can find some\n"
"way out of here."
msgstr ""

#. それに、もしかしたら、
#. その前に助けが来るかもしれないし…
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And help might even come before that."
msgstr ""

#. でも…逃げ道もなくて助けも来なかったら…？
msgctxt "0032 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"But...what if there *isn't* a way out? What if help\n"
"*never* comes?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、その時は……
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-If that happens..."
msgstr ""

#. ボクがキミをここから出してみせる！
#. どんな事をしても絶対にだよ！！
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...then I'll get you out of here myself! No matter\n"
"what it takes!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と、そこでボクの言葉は途切れた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When I said that, I paused...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>一瞬、自分の身に何が起きているのか、
#. わからなかった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I had no idea what had come over me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園…さん…？
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sayaka...?"
msgstr ""

#. お願い…助けて…
msgctxt "0038 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Please...help me..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女の声は…小さく震えていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Her voice was small and shaky.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どうして…こんな事になっちゃったの？
msgctxt "0040 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Why...? Why is this happening to me?"
msgstr ""

#. 殺すとか、殺されるとか…
#. そんなの……もう堪えられないッ！！
msgctxt "0041 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"To kill, or be killed... I just can't take this\n"
"anymore...!"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園…さん……
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sayaka..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………………
msgctxt "0043 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>そこで舞園さんは、
#. ようやくボクの胸から顔を上げると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Finally, she raised her face up from my chest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大きな濡れた目を、ボクに向けた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She looked at me with those big, wet eyes of hers.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. さっきの言葉…信じてもいいですか？
msgctxt "0046 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Can I...can I believe what you said?"
msgstr ""

#. えっ…？
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君が…私をここから出してくれるって言葉…
msgctxt "0048 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "That you'll help me get out?"
msgstr ""

#. どんな事をしても…絶対にって…
msgctxt "0049 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "No matter what it takes...?"
msgstr ""

#. も、もちろんだよ…！
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A-Absolutely!"
msgstr ""

#. 信じられるのは…苗木君だけなんです。
#. だから…お願い…
msgctxt "0051 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Makoto... You're the only one I can trust. So\n"
"please..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君だけは…何があっても…
#. ずっと私の味方でいて……
msgctxt "0052 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"No matter what happens, please always be there for me.\n"
"I need you on my side..."
msgstr ""

#. え……
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、当たり前じゃないか…！
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Of course I'll be there for you!"
msgstr ""

#. 何があっても、ボク達は味方同士だって！
#. だって、舞園さんは…
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No matter what, I'm always on your side. I mean..."
msgstr ""

#. ボクの助手じゃないか…
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...you *are* my assistant, after all."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0057 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …苗木君、ありがとう。
msgctxt "0058 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Thank you, Makoto."
msgstr ""

#. そう言ってくれると…
#. なんだか頑張れそうな気がします…
msgctxt "0059 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Hearing you say that, I feel like I can keep going."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君と一緒なら…
#. 頑張れそうな気がします。
msgctxt "0060 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I can get through this...as long as you're here with\n"
"me."
msgstr ""

#. だって、私は苗木君の助手だもんね。
msgctxt "0061 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Like you said, I'm your assistant."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこには、いつもの見慣れた笑顔が戻っていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The smile I'd come to know so well returned to her\n"
"face.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ少しぎこちない笑顔だったけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It felt a little forced, but still...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それでも、さっきまでよりは随分とマシだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was a huge improvement over how she was before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …たってますね！
msgctxt "0065 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...It's standing up!"
msgstr ""

#. キャアッ！！
msgctxt "0066 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Kyah!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木クン…たってますね！
msgctxt "0067 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Makoto! It's standing up!"
msgstr ""

#. たってるって…何がだよッ！
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "*What's* standing up!?"
msgstr ""

#. 言わずと知れた…
msgctxt "0069 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Do you even have to ask?"
msgstr ""

#. フラグですよッ！
msgctxt "0070 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Your flagpole!"
msgstr ""

#. …あっち行けよ！
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Get the hell out of here!"
msgstr ""

#. ヤダヤダぁ！！　ボクもまぜて～！！
msgctxt "0072 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "No! No! I wanna join in!"
msgstr ""

#. だったら、聞かせろ！
#. さっきの映像って…！
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Dammit! Well if you won't leave, then tell us what the\n"
"hell is up with those videos!"
msgstr ""

#. ハァハァ……出ますぅ……
msgctxt "0074 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ahh...it's about to come out..."
msgstr ""

#. 出ちゃいます！　ボクの真っ白な…
msgctxt "0075 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "It's gonna come out! My pristine, pure white..."
msgstr ""

#. 中綿がッ！！
msgctxt "0076 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...stuffing!"
msgstr ""

#. ドロリとした中綿がッ！！
msgctxt "0077 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"My honest, innocent stuffing is about to come gushing\n"
"out!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクはモノクマ目掛けて、
#. 全力のパンチを繰り出した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I balled up my fist, took aim, and swung as hard as I\n"
"could.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、全力の空振りをした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I had never put so much energy into a single motion\n"
"before in my life.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして全力でもんどり返って、
#. 全力で背中を打った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0080 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I leaned back, channeling all my power, and let go\n"
"with everything I had...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ウグッ！！
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Guwah!"
msgstr ""

#. だ、大丈夫ですか！？
msgctxt "0082 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "A-Are you okay!?"
msgstr ""

#. 今のはボクが避けてなかったら、校則違反だよ。
#. だけどね…
msgctxt "0083 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"If I hadn't avoided your punch, you would have just\n"
"violated school regulations."
msgstr ""

#. 遅い遅い遅い遅い遅い遅い遅いよーーーッ！！
msgctxt "0084 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "But boy are you slow slow slow slow SLOW!"
msgstr ""

#. １万円くらいのディナーコースなら
#. ペロリといけちゃう位に遅いよーッ！！
msgctxt "0085 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I could've downed a thousand-dollar full-course dinner\n"
"in the time it took you to finish your swing!"
msgstr ""

#. 速さもスピードも疾走感も情熱もほとばしる何かも
#. 悲壮感も大胆さも迷惑さも何もかも足りないーーッ！
msgctxt "0086 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Your speed, agility, alertness, passion, boldness,\n"
"sense of despair, antagonization, it's all lacking!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. なんだったんですかね、今の…？
msgctxt "0088 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "What the heck was that just now...?"
msgstr ""

#. ただの…嫌がらせだよ……
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "He just wanted to mess with us..."
msgstr ""

#. とりあえず…帰りましょうか…
msgctxt "0090 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Well, for now...you wanna just head back?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだね…
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんとなくいい雰囲気を、
#. モノクマに台無しにされたボクは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Monokuma had come along and swiftly destroyed the good\n"
"mood we'd just created.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんと一緒に、
#. 寄宿舎エリアへと戻った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sayaka and I headed back to the dorms.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな物を気にしている場合じゃない！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0095 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to worry about that right now!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はあ……
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…この向こうに…
#. ボクらをこんな目にあわせているヤツが…！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera... And whoever's putting us all\n"
"through this must be on the other side of it...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時計なんか…時間なんか…
#. もう、どうだっていい！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0098 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Who cares what time it is right now!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>クソ…この鉄板のせいで…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Dammit! Thanks to this stupid piece of metal...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…なんとかならないのかよッ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Isn't there anything we can do about it!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>クソ…この鉄板のせいで…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Dammit! Thanks to this stupid piece of metal...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…なんとかならないのかよッ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Isn't there anything we can do about it!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>初日に、ボクが突っ伏していた机…
#. 机の上には、あの安っぽいパンフレット…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0103 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's the desk I woke up on the day I got here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな物…どうだっていい！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0104 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But that doesn't matter now!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、舞園さんを追いかけてきたんだ…
#. ここを出て、どうするんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I came here to see Sayaka. What's the point of leaving\n"
"now...!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、舞園さんを追いかけてきたんだ…
#. ここを出て、どうするんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0106 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I came here to see Sayaka. What's the point of leaving\n"
"now...!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
